    <briefdescription>
<para>The plugin creates a debug object from when JITLink starts processing the corresponding <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_link_graph" kindref="compound">LinkGraph</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It provides access to the pass configuration of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1jitlink_1_1_link_graph" kindref="compound">LinkGraph</ref> and calls the finalization function, once the resulting link artifact was emitted. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
